Official-data-derived documentation chart
-----------------------------------------

File: man/figures/time-series-chart-1.png

This chart is a package-authored visual adaptation of official quarterly iron
ore export-volume series. It was generated through readreq's public interfaces
from:

- the req-2026-06 historical workbook, table
  history_commodity_iron_ore_steel, commodity iron_ore_steel, concept
  exports_quantity_iron_ore_b_total_iron_ore, geography Australia and
  quarterly frequency; and
- the req-2024-03, req-2025-03 and req-2026-06 forecast workbooks, table
  forecast_quarterly_export_volumes, commodity iron_ore, concept
  export_volume and geography Australia.

